# The image's build context is an allowlist (c005 design.md D12): everything is left out except
# what the Dockerfile's stages copy. So the private keys in spikes/**/secrets/, the local .claude/
# folder and any other local file can never enter a build, whatever lies in the working tree.
# A file a stage needs must be added here, or the build fails to find it.
*

# The backend and the frontend, as sources.
!src/RevolutReader.Api/
!src/RevolutReader.ServiceDefaults/
!src/RevolutReader.Web/

# The build rules at the root.
!global.json
!nuget.config
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!BannedSymbols.txt
!.editorconfig

# Never local build output or installed packages, even inside the folders above. These come after
# the exceptions, because the last matching line wins.
**/bin/
**/obj/
src/RevolutReader.Web/node_modules/
src/RevolutReader.Web/dist/
src/RevolutReader.Web/dev-dist/
src/RevolutReader.Web/coverage/
